                    <note type="editorial">
                        <p>23.3.1789 Matthias at Miss Williams'. 1786 subscribers to HMWilliams
                            poems Mrs M, Miss Albinia M, Miss C M, Thomas James M Esq (see Thomas
                            James Matthias DNB 1753/4-1835). As this one was part of a female
                            plural, either Marianne Nicholls (nee Popple) mother of TJM or (most
                            likely) his sister Albinia, and/or other sisters. Rev Norton Nicholls
                            (see 16.3.1789) left a legacy to TJM (PCC wills 1807). And see Weston
                            (26.10.1788)</p>
